# The build stamps content hashes into the HTML and inline-script hashes into
# the CSP in vercel.json. Production serves these files with LF endings, so a
# CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true on Windows) makes every hash wrong.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.aab binary
*.apk binary
*.keystore binary
